ices.Items: []\nSet lstChoices.ListIndex: -1\nSet btnCheck.Caption: 정답 확인\nSet lstChoices.Items: [54]\nSet lstChoices.Items: [54, 56]\nSet lstChoices.Items: [54, 56, 58]\nSet lstChoices.Items: [54, 56, 58, 64]\nSet lblScore.Caption: 점수: 2 · 최고 점수: 0\n> lstChoices.Select 1\nSet btnCheck.Caption: 확인: 56\n> btnCheck.Click\nMsgBox: 정답입니다!\n> OK\nSet lblNumber.Caption: 문제 6 / 7\nSet lblQuestion.Caption: 이 도형의 이름은?\nSet imgQuestion.Picture: triangle.png\nSet lstChoices.Items: []\nSet lstChoices.ListIndex: -1\nSet btnCheck.Caption: 정답 확인\nSet lstChoices.Items: [사각형]\nSet lstChoices.Items: [사각형, 원]\nSet lstChoices.Items: [사각형, 원, 삼각형]\nSet lstChoices.Items: [사각형, 원, 삼각형, 오각형]\nSet lblScore.Caption: 점수: 3 · 최고 점수: 0\n> lstChoices.Select 2\nSet btnCheck.Caption: 확인: 삼각형\n> btnCheck.Click\nMsgBox: 정답입니다!\n> OK\nSet lblNumber.Caption: 문제 7 / 7\nSet lblQuestion.Caption: 이 도형의 꼭짓점은 몇 개일까요?\nSet imgQuestion.Picture: pentagon.png\nSet lstChoices.Items: []\nSet lstChoices.ListIndex: -1\nSet btnCheck.Caption: 정답 확인\nSet lstChoices.Items: [4개]\nSet lstChoices.Items: [4개, 5개]\nSet lstChoices.Items: [4개, 5개, 6개]\nSet lstChoices.Items: [4개, 5개, 6개, 8개]\nSet lblScore.Caption: 점수: 4 · 최고 점수: 0\n> lstChoices.Select 1\nSet btnCheck.Caption: 확인: 5개\n> btnCheck.Click\nMsgBox: 정답입니다!\n> OK\nSettings: {\"best\":\"5\"}\nMsgBox: 7문제 가운데 5문제를 맞혔습니다. 새 최고 점수입니다! 처음부터 다시 합니다.\n> OK\nSet lblNumber.Caption: 문제 1 / 7\nSet lblQuestion.Caption: 대한민국의 수도는 어디일까요?\nSet imgQuestion.Picture: \nSet lstChoices.Items: []\nSet lstChoices.ListIndex: -1\nSet btnCheck.Caption: 정답 확인\nSet lstChoices.Items: [부산]\nSet lstChoices.Items: [부산, 서울]\nSet lstChoices.Items: [부산, 서울, 대구]\nSet lstChoices.Items: [부산, 서울, 대구, 인천]\nSet lblScore.Caption: 점수: 0 · 최고 점수: 5\n> Close\nClosed\n",
